\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. O disclose Thy lovely face
\par Quicken all my drooping powers;
\par Gasps my fainting soul for grace,
\par As a thirsty land for showers;
\par Haste, my Lord, no more delay,
\par Come, my Saviour, come away!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Well Thou know'st I cannot rest
\par Till I fully rest in Thee,
\par Till I am of Thee possessed,
\par Till, from every sin set free,
\par All the life of faith I prove,
\par All the joy and heaven of love.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. With me O continue, Lord!
\par Keep me, or from Thee I fly;
\par Strength and comfort from Thy word
\par Imperceptibly supply,
\par Hold me till I apprehend,
\par Make me faithful to the end.
\par Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

